# Import DATAMAN100 save; restore and earn original Beach VR membership pin.
COMMAND restore
TYPE DATAMAN100
KEY enter
ASSERT_LOCATION 13a d3
ASSERT_LOCATION 130 d3
LABEL dataman_restored
COMMAND up
COMMAND lie on couch
KEY space
KEY space
KEY space
KEY space
KEY space
KEY space
KEY space
COMMAND lie on couch
COMMAND wear collar
COMMAND push button
KEY space
KEY space
KEY space
LABEL vr_bar
COMMAND take glass
COMMAND give glass to bartender
COMMAND take glass
COMMAND give glass to bartender
COMMAND take glass
COMMAND give glass to bartender
COMMAND take glass
COMMAND give glass to bartender
COMMAND take glass
COMMAND give glass to bartender
COMMAND take glass
COMMAND put glass on scanner
KEY space
KEY space
COMMAND remove collar
COMMAND stand up
COMMAND take membership pin
ASSERT_LOCATION 2a9 d3
LABEL vr_pin_received
COMMAND save
TYPE VRFULL
KEY enter
